{'symbol': 'CMA', 'date': '2022-08-16 09:15:00', 'title': 'LINDA NOSEGBE NAMED NATIONAL COMMUNITY IMPACT MANAGER', 'text': 'DALLAS , AUG. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- COMERICA INCORPORATED (NYSE: CMA) HAS NAMED LINDA NOSEGBE, VICE PRESIDENT, SOUTHEAST EXTERNAL AFFAIRS MARKET MANAGER, AS VICE PRESIDENT, NATIONAL COMMUNITY IMPACT MANAGER. SHE WILL REPORT TO IRVIN ASHFORD JR., CHIEF COMMUNITY OFFICER.'}